@startuml seq_monthly_rate_calculation_pre
title Monthly Rate Calculation Pre - Sequence Diagram \nMonthlyRateCalculationPreCommand

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #333333
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #999999
skinparam noteBorderColor #F9A825
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7

actor       "Scheduler / Admin"              as admin
participant "MonthlyRateCalculationPreCommand"   as cmd
participant "CommonUtil"                     as util
participant "MonthlyRateCalculationPreLogic"     as logic
database    "trn_student_product"            as sp
database    "trn_charge"                     as charge
database    "mst_product"                    as product
database    "trn_ticket"                     as ticket
database    "trn_evaluation"                 as eval
database    "trn_prorated_refund_charge"     as refund
database    "log_monthly_rate_calculation_pre" as log_mrc_pre

== Initialisation ==

admin  -> cmd   : php artisan command:MonthlyRateCalculationPreCommand {exeDate}
cmd    -> util  : setSystemDate(exeDate)
cmd    -> util  : getTargetFromTo()\n→ [startDate, endDate]
cmd    -> logic : execute(startDate, endDate)

== Transaction Begin ==

logic  -> logic : DB::beginTransaction()\n[mysql + zipan]

== CTE Query Execution ==

note over logic
  Same WITH RECURSIVE SQL query
  as MonthlyRateCalculationLogic
  (identical structure, different output table)
end note

logic  -> sp      : READ trn_student_product\nWHERE main_product=1 AND status=1
logic  -> product : READ mst_product\nWHERE lesson_type=2
logic  -> charge  : READ trn_charge\nWHERE status=1 AND paid=1\nLEFT JOIN trn_prorated_refund_charge
logic  -> refund  : READ trn_prorated_refund_charge
logic  -> ticket  : READ trn_ticket\nWHERE ticket_type=3\n(TicketMonths CTE — recursive)
logic  -> eval    : READ trn_evaluation\nWHERE ticket_type=3\nAND status IN(0,1)\nAND result IN(0,1,2,3,4)

note over logic
  CTEs: MonthlyUsage → FilteredUsage →
  OrderedMonths → Grouped →
  GroupedWithOrderCheck → FinalResult
  WHERE target_ym = YYYYMM
end note

logic  -> logic : Fetch bizRows (mysql)\nFetch zipanRows (zipan)

== Result Handling ==

alt No rows generated
    logic -> logic : rollBack()\nLog warning: no_rows_generated
else Rows exist
    logic -> log_mrc_pre : INSERT INTO log_monthly_rate_calculation_pre\n(bizmates rows)
    logic -> log_mrc_pre : INSERT INTO log_monthly_rate_calculation_pre\n(zipan rows)
    logic -> logic       : DB::commit()\n[mysql + zipan]
end

logic --> cmd : return
cmd   --> admin : Command::SUCCESS

@enduml
